			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Bipolar I\n\nCondition hub: episode and course description, competing mechanistic hypotheses, and how treatment evidence is organised by phase.\n\n[[Bipolar I Map|Open the domain map]] - snapshot of 2026-09-25; the map's *In this folder* section is the live view.",
