		},
		{
			"id": "t0_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Bipolar depression and mixed features]]**\n*condition* - 5 sources\n\nDepressive episodes in bipolar disorder, mixed presentations, and why they are distinguished from unipolar depression.",
			"x": 30,
